{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 26, :comments ["The sense of <b>all who touch them</b>: they are the carcasses mentioned above; he becomes impure according to the rule of those mentioned, which is until evening. There is a sect of the Sadducee type who said that all who touch them while they are alive become impure. There is no need to refute words of madness, for Scripture forbade only their flesh, and said, and you shall not touch their carcasses."], :book :leviticus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 11, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:09:31.787306637Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}